Limit: "Candidate ordering covers retained GSC page rows only. Missing pages and missing GA rows are unknown, not zero."
Limit: "GA is associated by configured origin and exact path/query only, not verified canonical identity. Landing page is session entry, not event location; no cross-provider funnel is computed."
Limit: "Technical observations describe their collection times; they need not represent the historical reporting period. No live requests or imported-claim verification occur."
"
,
}
`;

